Title: 200 AMSTERDAM: THE VERTICAL CITY
Credit: Written for the Screen by
Author: Danny Bouldiez
Episode: PART 10: THE AWAKENING OF THE GIANTS (CHAPTER 09)

====

INT. SUB-LEVEL 5 - PUMP CORRIDOR - NIGHT

Water is waist-deep. 

DEVS ONE and MARCUS battle their way toward the auxiliary diesel generator vault. 

A high-voltage transformer SPARKS furiously, throwing bright blue flashes across the churning black water.

                         MARCUS
          If this transformer floods while energized, the whole 
          sub-level becomes an electric chair!

Devs dives beneath the freezing water. 

UNDERWATER: Devs reaches the mechanical breaker lever. He pulls with all his strength. 

*CLANK!* The power cuts. 

Devs surfaces, gasping for air in the pitch black.

                         DEVS ONE
          We have twenty minutes before the storm vault fills to the ceiling!

FADE TO BLACK.
